<title>ITALY: EIB seen issuing 1 trln lire bond on Italy market.</title>
<headline>EIB seen issuing 1 trln lire bond on Italy market.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank is about to launch a one trillion lire floating rate bond on the Italian domestic market, bond market sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bond, which will be offered on February 20 and 21 with settlement at the end of the month, will have a maturity of at least seven years.</p>
<p>This would be the first domestic issue by the EIB on the Italian domestic market this year.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129526</p>
</text>
